snsf_test.snsf was generated by tests/m3/fixtures/gen_snsf_test.py (row I705a): an original SNSF whose hand-assembled 65816 ROM does the
SPC700 boot handshake, uploads a hand-assembled SPC700 program and plays a full-volume noise voice on the S-DSP (6 s plus 1 s fade).
Original to this project and released as CC0. No Nintendo code is used.
